<!-- 快递代取 · 彩色页头 → 在库包裹 → 驿站 / 规则 → 我的申请 → 预约 -->
<view class="page page--fbar">
  <view class="pgh pgh--teal">
    <view class="sbar light" style="padding-top:{{statusBarHeight}}px">
      <text>邻里小助手</text>
      <text>● ● ●</text>
    </view>
    <view class="pgh-nav">
      <text class="pgh-bk" bindtap="goBack">‹</text>
      <text class="pgh-t">快递代收</text>
      <text class="pgh-rt" bindtap="onOpenSpots">存放点</text>
    </view>
    <view class="pgh-k">
      <view class="pgh-ic"><view class="ic ic-l icw ic-package" /></view>
      <view>
        <view class="pgh-lb" style="margin-bottom:6px">1 号楼驿站 · 我的包裹</view>
        <view class="pgh-num">{{packages.length}}<text class="unit">件在库</text></view>
      </view>
      <view class="pgh-chip" data-k="pickup" bindtap="onOpenForm">预约送上门 ›</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="body">
    <!-- 在库包裹 -->
    <view wx:for="{{packages}}" wx:key="code" class="tkt">
      <view class="tk-lb">
        {{item.name}}
        <text class="tag ok tk-tag">可取件</text>
      </view>
      <view class="tk-cd">{{item.code}}</view>
      <view class="tk-dl"></view>
      <view class="tk-r"><text>入库时间</text><text>{{item.timeText}}</text></view>
      <view class="tk-r"><text>保管期限</text><text>{{item.keep}}</text></view>
      <view class="tk-a">
        <view class="btn3 ghost" data-k="pickup" bindtap="onOpenForm">预约送上门</view>
        <view class="btn3 solid" data-k="pickup" bindtap="onOpenForm">去取件</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <!-- 驿站信息 -->
    <view class="dash">
      <view class="d-h"><text class="dh-b">驿站信息</text><text class="dh-em">距你 210 m · 8:00-21:00</text></view>
      <view class="notice-list">
        <view>无人值守时段可到南门岗亭取；</view>
        <view>超 3 天未取将由驿站退回快递员；</view>
        <view>大件请提前打电话让驿站帮搬。</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <!-- 代取规则 -->
    <view class="dash">
      <view class="d-h"><text class="dh-b">代取服务费</text><text class="dh-em">线下结算</text></view>
      <view wx:for="{{rules}}" wx:key="label" class="rule-row">
        <text class="rule-l">{{item.label}}</text>
        <text class="rule-v">{{item.value}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="rule-note">费用由跑腿志愿者上门时线下结算，本页不收款、不代付货款。</view>
    </view>

    <!-- 我的申请 -->
    <view class="sec">
      <view class="st">
        <text class="st-b">我的申请</text>
        <text class="st-e">可随时撤销</text>
      </view>
      <view wx:if="{{orders.length === 0}}" class="empty">还没有代取申请，点下方按钮预约</view>
      <view wx:for="{{orders}}" wx:key="id" class="ord">
        <view class="ord-l">
          <view class="ord-n">{{item.company}} · {{item.sizeText}}</view>
          <view class="ord-s">{{item.kindText}} · {{item.spotText}}</view>
          <view class="ord-s">{{item.timeText}}</view>
          <view class="ord-s">服务费 {{item.feeText}} · 跑腿志愿者线下结算</view>
        </view>
        <view class="ord-r">
          <text class="tag warn">{{item.statusText}}</text>
          <text class="ord-x" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onCancel">取消</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="page-note">
      代收属于便民服务，不代付货款、不拆包；破损请在驿站当场拍照登记。
    </view>

    <ai-bar page="express" />
  </view>

  <view class="fbar">
    <view class="fbar-sum">
      <view class="fbar-t">代取小件 2 元起</view>
      <view class="fbar-s">服务费线下结算 · 本页不收款</view>
    </view>
    <view class="fbar-btn" data-k="pickup" bindtap="onOpenForm">预约代取</view>
  </view>

  <!-- 预约弹层 -->
  <view wx:if="{{sheet === 'form'}}" class="mask" bindtap="onCloseSheet">
    <view class="sheet show" catchtap="noop" catchtouchmove="noop">
      <view class="sh-hd">{{kindName}}</view>
      <view class="sh-sub">1 号楼驿站 · 8:00-21:00</view>

      <view class="lbl">服务类型<text class="em">必选</text></view>
      <view class="chips">
        <view class="chip {{kind === 'pickup' ? 'on' : ''}}" data-k="pickup" bindtap="onPickKind">帮我代取</view>
        <view class="chip {{kind === 'send' ? 'on' : ''}}" data-k="send" bindtap="onPickKind">帮我代寄</view>
      </view>

      <view class="lbl">快递公司<text class="em">必选</text></view>
      <view class="chips">
        <view
          wx:for="{{companies}}"
          wx:key="*this"
          class="chip {{company === item ? 'on' : ''}}"
          data-v="{{item}}"
          bindtap="onPickCompany"
        >{{item}}</view>
      </view>

      <view class="lbl">包裹大小<text class="em">必选</text></view>
      <view class="chips">
        <view
          wx:for="{{sizes}}"
          wx:key="key"
          class="chip {{size === item.key ? 'on' : ''}}"
          data-s="{{item.key}}"
          bindtap="onPickSize"
        >{{item.name}} · {{item.fee}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="size-hint">{{sizeName}} 服务费 {{sizeFee}}，由跑腿志愿者线下结算。</view>

      <view class="lbl">取件点位<text class="em">必选</text></view>
      <view class="chips">
        <view
          wx:for="{{spotNames}}"
          wx:key="*this"
          class="chip {{spotName === item ? 'on' : ''}}"
          data-n="{{item}}"
          bindtap="onPickSpot"
        >{{item}}</view>
      </view>

      <view class="lbl">{{kind === 'pickup' ? '取件码' : '寄件单号'}}<text class="em">必填</text></view>
      <input class="inp" placeholder="仅用于本次代取，不会展示给他人" maxlength="32" value="{{code}}" bindinput="onInputCode" />
      <view class="lbl">楼栋房号<text class="em">必填</text></view>
      <input class="inp" placeholder="例：3 号楼 2 单元 502" maxlength="32" value="{{room}}" bindinput="onInputRoom" />
      <view class="lbl">联系电话<text class="em">必填</text></view>
      <input class="inp" type="number" placeholder="用于送达联系" maxlength="15" value="{{contact}}" bindinput="onInputContact" />
      <view class="lbl">备注<text class="em">选填</text></view>
      <textarea class="ta" placeholder="例如：放门口快递架，不用敲门" maxlength="120" value="{{note}}" bindinput="onInputNote" />

      <view class="pay-note">
        本页不收款、不代付货款。服务费由跑腿志愿者线下结算，请在交接时当面确认。
      </view>
      <view class="sh-btns">
        <view class="btn ghost" bindtap="onCloseSheet">取消</view>
        <view class="btn" bindtap="onSubmit">{{submitting ? '提交中…' : '提交预约'}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 存放点 -->
  <view wx:if="{{sheet === 'spots'}}" class="mask" bindtap="onCloseSheet">
    <view class="sheet show" catchtap="noop" catchtouchmove="noop">
      <view class="sh-hd">快递存放点</view>
      <view class="sh-sub">共 {{spots.length}} 个点位</view>
      <view class="spot-list">
        <view wx:for="{{spots}}" wx:key="name" class="row">
          <view class="k tint-teal"><view class="ic ic-s ic-package" /></view>
          <view class="m">
            <view class="rb">{{item.name}}</view>
            <view class="rs">{{item.addr}} · {{item.note}}</view>
          </view>
          <view class="v">{{item.hours}}</view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="sh-btns">
        <view class="btn" bindtap="onCloseSheet">知道了</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
